OL,3,GNEWSACouncil ends financial year with
OL,4,A#800k underspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council ended the last financial year
OL,7,Fwith an #804,000 underspend on its
OL,8,Fbudget, it has been revealed.
OL,10,FCannock Chase District Council in
OL,11,FStaffordshire confirmed there had been
OL,12,Fa "favourable variance" in its 2025/26
OL,13,Ffinances, during a meeting on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe authority said it was a result of a
OL,16,F"technical adjustment" in costs
OL,17,Frelating to levelling up projects in
OL,18,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
